Package: DCC
Title: Analysis of Central Composite Designs
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Wanderley", "Xavier Pereira", 
           email = "first.last@example.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for generation and statistical analysis of Central Composite Designs (CCD). 
    The package allows experimental matrix generation, model fitting, ANOVA, estimation of effects 
    and coefficients, response surface visualization, contour plots, Pareto charts and automated 
    analytical report export. Designed for researchers, students and professionals working with 
    experimental design and process optimization.
